d=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MIN}\">\\(\\mathrm{MIN}\\)</span> 见上游；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Immune}\">\\(\\operatorname{Immune}\\)</span> 采用无限且无无限 c.e. 子集的定义。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7954d66ef8c1e7be\" href=\"?note=7954d66ef8c1e7be\" title=\"20-df-minimal-program-indices\">20-df-minimal-program-indices</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"991aaed4a87c5835\" href=\"?note=991aaed4a87c5835\" title=\"20-df-immune\">20-df-immune</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}indices\\text{-}immune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Immune}(\\mathrm{MIN}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}indices\\text{-}immune}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Immune}(\\mathrm{MIN}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>常值函数有无限多个不同外延类，所以 MIN 无限。若存在无限 c.e. V⊆MIN，定义全可计算 f(n) 为该枚举中首次大于 n 的索引。递归定理给 φ_n=φ_f(n)，但 n&lt;f(n) 与 f(n)∈MIN 冲突。证明不假设能判定 MIN。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.2.9(i)；印刷页 32；PDF 第 68 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-minimal-program-indices","status":"resolved","id":"7954d66ef8c1e7be","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-minimal-program-indices]]","embed":false},{"target"